The Atomic Cafe is a 1982 American documentary film directed by
Kevin Rafferty, Jayne Loader and Pierce Rafferty.

11
00:55:38,823 --> 00:55:44,823
It is a compilation of clips from newsreels, military training films, and other footage produced
in the United States early in the Cold War on the subject of nuclear warfare.

12
