Without any narration, the footage is edited and presented in a manner to
demonstrate how misinformation and propaganda was used by the U.S.

13
01:05:45,882 --> 01:05:51,882
government and popular culture to ease fears about
nuclear weapons among the American public.

14
01:10:49,411 --> 01:10:55,411
In 2016, the film was selected  for preservation in the United States National Film Registry by the
Library of Congress as being "culturally, historically, or aesthetically significant."

15
